msgid ""
"Configures :ref:`code-hosting-bitbucket-cloud-pull-requests` by "
"changing :setting:`BITBUCKETCLOUD_CREDENTIALS`."
msgstr ""
"Konfiguriert :ref:`code-hosting-bitbucket-cloud-pull-requests` durch Ändern "
