msgid ""
"Configures :ref:`code-hosting-azure-devops-pull-requests` by "
"changing :setting:`AZURE_DEVOPS_CREDENTIALS`."
msgstr ""
"Konfiguriert :ref:`code-hosting-azure-devops-pull-requests` durch Ändern "
"von :setting:`AZURE_DEVOPS_CREDENTIALS`."

