"reports/`."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The top-level ``languages`` field on user REST API responses has been "
"removed; use ``profile.languages`` instead. See :ref:`api-user-profile`."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"There are changes in :file:`settings_example.py`, most notably the new "
"``STORAGES`` configuration and removal of the ``COMPRESS_*`` settings; "
"please adjust your settings accordingly."
msgstr ""
"Es gibt Änderungen in :file:`settings_example.py`, insbesondere die neue "
"``STORAGES``-Konfiguration und das Entfernen der ``COMPRESS_*``-"
"Einstellungen; bitte passen Sie Ihre Einstellungen entsprechend an."

msgid ""
"Running :program:`weblate compress` is no longer "
"necessary; :program:`weblate collectstatic --noinput` now prepares versioned "
"static assets without clearing the static storage."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"`All changes in detail <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/167?"
